3. Where a vehicle found in an HDB parking place is removed, detained or immobilised under section 15(1) of the Act, the following charges must be paid for the release of the vehicle under section 15(4) of the Act:
(a)if the vehicle is removed — a removal charge of the applicable amount specified in Part 1 of the Schedule;
(b)a storage charge at the applicable rate specified in Part 1 of the Schedule for each day or part of a day during which the vehicle is detained, starting on the day the vehicle is detained;
(c)if the vehicle is immobilised —$109.
[S 189/2026 wef 02/04/2026]

4. Where a vehicle found in a URA parking place is removed, detained or immobilised under section 15(1) of the Act, the following charges must be paid for the release of the vehicle under section 15(4) of the Act:
(a)if the vehicle is removed — a removal charge of the applicable amount specified in Part 2 of the Schedule;
(b)a storage charge at the applicable rate specified in Part 2 of the Schedule for each day or part of a day during which the vehicle is detained, starting at 12 noon on the day immediately after the day the vehicle is detained;
(c)if the vehicle is immobilised — $109.
[S 189/2026 wef 02/04/2026]
